\section{Overview}

Given the bookings of one day, we want to know when we are free during
the working day 08:00--17:00.  The program has three parts, which we
present in the order the data flows through them:
\begin{description}
\item[Parsing] turns lines such as [[09:00-10:30]] into pairs of minutes
  since midnight.
\item[Merging] sorts the bookings and fuses those that overlap or touch.
\item[Gap finding] walks the merged bookings and reports what is left of
  the working day, formatted as text again.
\end{description}
The module [[freeslots.py]] ties them together and the file
[[test_freeslots.py]] checks each part.

